{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/22","id":5003861836,"node_id":"PR_kwDON1sLX88AAAABKkDfTA","html_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/22","diff_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/22.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/22.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/22","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/22/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/22/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/22/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/statuses/72d952d8300e24b6a1940a8acc33c8d882e41212","number":22,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make editor geometry symmetric and preserve source colors","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #21.\n\nClicking a network now opens the editor with symmetric loop defaults, cross-like starts and the colors shown at the source. Bend changes free-link curvature and self-loop width; free endpoints stay anchored. Gallery, theory and background-rain geometry retain their original construction.\n\n- Match dark/light colors from gallery cards, share icons and theory examples; remove gallery hover underlines.\n- Preserve independent angles, gaps, marker controls, placements, overlap reduction, exports and saved styles. Keep legacy tangent rotation selectable and recognize older explicit custom-color URLs.\n- Verify both supplied URLs against their controls, then edit/share/reload to the same SVG. The screenshot values already parsed correctly; inherited defaults and bend construction caused the differences.\n\n### Reproduction and verification\n\nOpen `/network/?code=1122` and `/network/?code=00000000`, vary Bend, and compare with gallery navigation. Equal endpoint angles/gaps give point-symmetric loops; free endpoints no longer rotate with Bend. Also hover a gallery card and open it in both themes.\n\nAutomated coverage: `src/links/geometry-21.test.js`, `src/pages/network-21.test.jsx`, and `npm run test:network:issue21`. Strict symmetry samples, all 4,181 small editor configurations, and 4,693 unchanged gallery/rain SVG hashes guard geometry and scope. Browser checks verify supplied settings, share/reload, dark/light navigation, hover, SVG export and mobile overflow.\n\nValidation: 693 unit tests pass; repository checks and production build pass; Chromium, Firefox and WebKit pass the new and existing browser suites. CI also verifies CV PDFs and the Pages build artifact.\n\n### Before / after\n\n| Original editor | Updated editor |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Before: unequal loops and different colors](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-before-default-1122.png?raw=true) | ![After: symmetric loops and matching colors](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-default-1122.png?raw=true) |\n| ![Before: rotated free links](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-before-default-00000000.png?raw=true) | ![After: anchored curves and cross starts](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-default-00000000.png?raw=true) |\n\n![Editor controls with the first supplied configuration](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-supplied-1.png?raw=true)\n\n[Complete case study, settings audit, requirement inventory, timeline, root causes, library research, raw logs/data and browser evidence](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/tree/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21). All causes were traced to this application; no external dependency defect required an upstream report.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T10:21:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T10:47:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T10:47:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T10:47:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"38afa6dbafe5da0bcdd1778bb647d2dbf89aee39","assignee":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://